1
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,800
Take your jewelry,

2
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,839
skincare products,

3
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:20,960
carbon pens,

4
00:00:21,839 --> 00:00:22,800
and sketchbooks.

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,600
And this book.

6
00:00:27,679 --> 00:00:29,039
Take the bamboo shoots

7
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:30,280
given by the villagers.

8
00:00:30,719 --> 00:00:31,480
It's a token of their kindness.

9
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,399
How did I bring this out

10
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,039
last time I left the palace?

11
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,479
Good thing Gu Jiachen has ascended the throne.

12
00:00:44,479 --> 00:00:45,159
I don't need it anymore.

13
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,079
But

14
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:52,880
I probably won't have to go to the palace anymore.

15
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:54,840
[Why not]

16
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,079
[use this to]

17
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,280
[visit him one more time?]

18
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:20,879
Your Majesty,

19
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:22,599
the Queen Mother

20
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:23,959
sent this over,

21
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:25,159
asking you

22
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:27,760
to take a look.

23
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,680
What is it?

24
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:33,040
Portraits of noble girls of marriageable age.

25
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:35,040
The Queen Mother said

26
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:37,640
that you've been on the throne for over a month,

27
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:38,840
and the harem is still vacant,

28
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:41,480
which is not proper according to tradition.

29
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,159
Why do these portrait painters

30
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,959
all paint women

31
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:54,640
as if from the same mold?

32
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,640
Change the hairstyle,

33
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,319
change the clothing,

34
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,599
and it's a different person.

35
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,840
Perhaps the painters' skills are not refined.

36
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:02,079
Their skills are lacking.

37
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,319
I think they lack the right mindset.

38
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,200
Painting the bones is easier than painting the skin.

39
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,799
If they can't even capture the essence,

40
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,919
what's the point of painting portraits?

41
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,800
They should learn more from her.

42
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:14,639
Who are you referring to?

43
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:16,919
I...

44
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,199
It's the time.

45
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,560
Why didn't I meet her?

46
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,719
I always...

47
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:30,800
Ten days later,

48
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:31,759
at the west side of the bridge,

49
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,159
at the end of the morning.

50
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,319
You brat,

51
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,400
we've known each other for so long,

52
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:38,599
but you still haven't told me

53
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,639
your name.

54
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,680
Shen Li.

55
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:44,879
The discarded consort in the cold palace,

56
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,599
is her name

57
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,120
Feng Zhiwei?

58
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:52,879
Yes.

59
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:53,759
Your Majesty,

60
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,000
why do you ask?

61
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,879
Feng Zhiwei,

62
00:03:00,599 --> 00:03:01,479
I always feel

63
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,360
I've forgotten something.

64
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,360
Shen Li,

65
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,120
I'm going out for a walk.

66
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,319
Mr. Qingqiao is really good at painting.

67
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,560
I don't know when I can

68
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:24,159
have the honor to meet such a great painter.

69
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:24,879
Being an emperor

70
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,959
is quite something.

71
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,439
The entire palace is heavily guarded.

72
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,079
I can't get close at all.

73
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,000
[Forget it.]

74
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:34,920
[Once this painting is done,]

75
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,519
[I'll be leaving.]

76
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,240
[Our promise at Qing Bridge,]

77
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,839
[I've come here twice alone.]

78
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,920
[It's almost fulfilled.]

79
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,120
Gu Jiachen.

80
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,360
Lady,

81
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,720
have we met before?

82
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,319
No,

83
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,639
Your Majesty must have mistaken me for someone else.

84
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,000
Wait.

85
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,199
Standing beside you,

86
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,720
I feel a sense of familiarity.

87
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,680
Do we really not know each other?

88
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,279
I don't know you.

89
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,800
I have something to do. I'll go.

90
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:25,600
Wait.

91
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:28,879
Why does that girl

92
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:31,839
have something from my past?

93
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,160
One piece in the East Palace, one piece with you.

94
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:41,839
You, a painter...

95
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:44,079
Painter,

96
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,800
could you possibly forge a token?

97
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,480
Your Majesty,

98
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,399
if I say

99
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,639
I picked this up off the ground,

100
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,360
would you believe me?

101
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,759
Yes.

102
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,040
If you can pick up another seal

103
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,319
from the ground now,

104
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:58,920
I'll believe you.

105
00:06:00,319 --> 00:06:00,879
Your Majesty,

106
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,959
you have to allow life to have

107
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,120
some accidents, right?

108
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,560
You can't be so domineering.

109
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,360
♪Domineering♪

110
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,759
♪is indeed my way♪

111
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,600
♪Domineering♪

112
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,839
♪is indeed my way♪

113
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,680
What are you thinking about?

114
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,160
Have you made up your excuse?

115
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,199
If not,

116
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,680
don't blame me for keeping you here.

117
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:38,839
Assassins!

118
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:40,160
Shen Li,

119
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:41,600
keep her here.

120
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:44,920
Why do you do this again?

121
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:04,959
You...

122
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,920
Fine, you came back with me.

123
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:08,319
But why do you have to

124
00:07:08,319 --> 00:07:09,120
live here?

125
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:11,439
I told you,

126
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,160
I just want to know

127
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:14,839
why I feel

128
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:15,879
so familiar with you.

129
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,399
How would I know?

130
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:19,399
I don't even know you.

131
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,079
That's okay.

132
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,439
From today on,

133
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:25,920
let me

134
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,079
get to know you.

135
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,480
You...

136
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,439
I can pay you rent.

137
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:33,560
You can paint your paintings as usual,

138
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:35,240
and I will read the memorials here.

139
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,040
I will never interfere with your normal life.

140
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,079
At the beginning,

141
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,319
you always called me Miss,

142
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,399
and were very polite.

143
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,519
Now,

144
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:43,839
you play rogue.

145
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:44,879
So what?

146
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,560
You also played tricks

147
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:47,720
on the Crown Prince's token.

148
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,439
You can't say that.

149
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,920
That's different.

150
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,600
How is it different?

151
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,319
You once, and I once.

152
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,720
We're even.

153
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,360
However,

154
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,160
I was wrong this time.

155
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,560
I'll make it up to you.

156
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:10,079
The plan of visiting other countries.

157
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,720
In March,

158
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,759
we'll go to the south of the Yangtze River first

159
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:16,639
to see willows at the Slender West Lake.

160
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,360
Then head west,

161
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,279
to the frontier,

162
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,000
and ride for a day and night.

163
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,519
Is this your wish?

164
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,240
Then it's perfect.

165
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,800
After I ascend the throne,

166
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,439
I'll inspect various regions as tradition.

167
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,800
Jiangnan, the frontier, and the northwest,

168
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:32,799
I'll visit them all.

169
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,399
Once I'm done with this,

170
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:36,720
I'll take you out.

171
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:39,399
When I go on my tour,

172
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:40,159
you can paint.

173
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:41,200
We won't be delayed.

174
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,879
We'll fulfill your dream

175
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,519
of traveling the world together.

176
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,000
You don't have to do this.

177
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,159
You don't want to talk about the past,

178
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,159
that's fine.

179
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:54,919
But I always feel like

180
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:56,840
I'll regret it if I don't take you

181
00:08:58,639 --> 00:08:59,399
on trips.

182
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:02,799
Silly boy.

183
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,440
What are you talking about?

184
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,240
Nothing.

185
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,000
The tea's gone cold.

186
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:07,679
I'll go get you some more.

187
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,200
Wait.

188
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,039
This jade pendant will cover the bill.

189
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,279
If you want more,

190
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:14,840
go get it yourself.

191
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,679
This place

192
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:31,000
is for drinking,

193
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,200
tea,

194
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,720
and boat rides with friends.

195
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:37,879
Friends?

196
00:09:40,639 --> 00:09:41,639
I always feel

197
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:44,559
it's not about friends.

198
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:47,720
Little Phoenix,

199
00:09:48,039 --> 00:09:48,960
please.

200
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,440
Just go out with me

201
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,879
to relax, okay?

202
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,480
[I've dreamed of it many times.]

203
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,679
[One day,]

204
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,000
[we'll leave together.]

205
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:00,960
[First, head south.]

206
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,600
[Ride for a day and night.]

207
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:05,080
[To a place where we can't see the palace walls.]

208
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,519
[I never thought]

209
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:21,320
[that even with all memories erased,]

210
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:23,000
[we'd meet again at Qing Bridge.]

211
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,000
[What's this called?]

212
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,200
[Fate's plan is the greatest.]

213
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,879
[Live each day as it comes.]

214
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,000
[He's here today.]

215
00:10:36,559 --> 00:10:37,759
[Whether he's here tomorrow]

216
00:10:37,759 --> 00:10:38,639
[is another day's concern.]

217
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:42,600
Gu Jiachen,

218
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:46,360
your room rate doesn't include meals.

219
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,559
Go cook with me later.

220
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:50,879
What are you yelling at?

221
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,639
You know,

222
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,279
that sunset in the wilderness

223
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,159
is truly breathtaking.

224
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,320
I must paint it

225
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:06,879
several times to capture its beauty.

226
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:09,519
You've been

227
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:10,519
talking about it the whole way.

228
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,480
Because it's worth talking about.

229
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,000
Your Majesty has returned!

230
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,559
Princess, come out!

231
00:12:15,759 --> 00:12:16,240
They're here.

232
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:18,840
Your Majesty.

233
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:19,600
Lady Feng.

234
00:12:20,279 --> 00:12:21,039
You're finally back.

235
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,279
Did you have fun?

236
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,240
Mr. Qingqiao.

237
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:28,039
I've been waiting for you.

238
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:31,279
Sir,

239
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:33,159
have you finished the new draft?

240
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:33,759
Let me see.

241
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:35,039
Come.

242
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,240
Your Majesty, you look pale.

243
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,759
Are you tired from the journey?

244
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,080
Why are you here again?

245
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:45,519
Princess Arietty

246
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:47,240
insisted on seeing your paintings.

247
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:49,279
I'm just here to accompany her.

248
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,559
I think you also want to know, right?

249
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,639
Since I knew you are Mr. Qingqiao,

250
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:57,440
this yard

251
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:59,000
has never been quiet.

252
00:13:00,279 --> 00:13:02,279
Your Majesty, what are you talking about?

253
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:04,000
Nothing.

254
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,960
Now that you're here,

255
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,200
why don't you go cook?

256
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:08,200
Cook?

257
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:11,200
But I always mess up.

258
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,559
Then learn until you do it well.

259
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:15,039
Go.

260
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,559
Gu Jiachen.

261
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,519
What are you doing outside for so long?

262
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:31,240
Princess Arietty brought you good tea.

263
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:32,440
Don't you love drinking tea the most?

264
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,960
I like the tea my sister makes.

265
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:37,519
Don't talk nonsense.

266
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:38,840
What's wrong?

267
00:13:39,159 --> 00:13:40,559
Don't you usually like me

268
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:41,519
to call you this way?

269
00:13:42,799 --> 00:13:44,080
What's the story

270
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,399
behind this name?

271
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:48,799
All right.

272
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:49,759
Go and cook.

273
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,679
If Shen Li cooks,

274
00:13:50,759 --> 00:13:51,919
we'll all have to go hungry tonight.

275
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:53,399
Go.
